Z||000028||wkayl||02-19-2000||01:46 PM||||RossT<BR>I did read it.  Sorry I didn't get back with a comment yet.  That sounds like a little better car than I have.  I hade a 61 Lark my Jr. year in H.S. back in 72.  A year after I graduated I bought another 61 Lark XIII cruiser with 259 V8, 4bbl, dual exhaust,twin traction and the same color (it was 13 years old at the time, funny that was how old my Fiero was when I got it).  My son came home from the hospital in it when he was born in '82.  It was the first car he ever drove in '93. And when he got his liscense in '98 it whas the first car he drove.  I told him he would get it when I die, but don't count on that for a long long time. You can see a picture of it along with my Fiero at: <A HREF="http://www.homestead.com/wkayl/cars.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.homestead.com/wkayl/cars.html</A>  ||||reg||1
